{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cThis is the last train. And you're its only passenger.\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, the city went silent.<br>No signals, no rescue.<br>The streets were filled with blood, screams, and the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, the city belongs to the infected.<br>And you\u2019ve boarded the <strong>last working subway train</strong>.<br>Your destination: the city center\u2014where your family might still be alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But this train isn\u2019t just a way out.<br>At each station, <strong>you must get off</strong> and <strong>activate all the fuses</strong> to move on.<br>You have 3 minutes.<br>Miss it, and you'll be overrun by a <strong>horde of zombies rushing from the previous station</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The DeadLine</strong> is a\u00a0<strong>first-person roguelike survival FPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">where you ride a train through a zombie-infested city to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Weapon System</strong><br>Unlock Normal, Rare, Epic, and Legendary guns,<br>with both realistic and wild weaponry to enjoy fast-paced gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/03c6513e68bf9b83fbb8b3667ff90bde.poster.avif?t=1751874769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/03c6513e68bf9b83fbb8b3667ff90bde.mp4?t=1751874769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time-Limited Missions</strong><br>Complete objectives and return to the train in under 3 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/d5df289cb571afe6c65eeceb2113286d.poster.avif?t=1751874769\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/d5df289cb571afe6c65eeceb2113286d.webp?t=1751874769\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relentless Zombie Hordes</strong><br>Fail to meet the deadline and get swarmed by<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/e763685b65f010ed86966e9c4db80e69.poster.avif?t=1751874769\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/e763685b65f010ed86966e9c4db80e69.webp?t=1751874769\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> zombies from the previous station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill Chips &amp; Upgrades</strong><br>Find skill chips and power up your character for the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/9acaf2a06a5eee0b751beffcfeb1a3a5.poster.avif?t=1751874769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/9acaf2a06a5eee0b751beffcfeb1a3a5.webm?t=1751874769\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;May the odds be ever in your favor.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The train departs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your brutal fight for survival begins now.</strong></p>","backgroun